        "type": "TEXT",
        "x": 44,
        "y": 370,
        "width": 507,
        "height": 46,
        "content": "Confidential information means any non-public information disclosed by one party to the other, in any form, that is marked confidential or that a reasonable person would understand to be confidential given its nature and the circumstances of disclosure.",
